    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1525">

                <pb facs="1282" n="1178" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1178"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 17554/22.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American Chargé d’Affaires at Lima.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1910-03-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 11, 1910</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your March 7. This Department would sincerely deplore haste or severance of
                    diplomatic relations between Chile and Peru on account of dispute over status of
                    priests at Tacna. Department believes that at present the giving of instructions
                    to our Chargé d’Affaires at Santiago to take charge of Peruvian Legation would
                    be premature.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
